SUMMARY:Run - 4x800m Intervals
DESCRIPTION:2 km warm-up. 4x800m @ 4:20-4:25/km with 2 min easy jog recovery. 1-1.5 km cool-down. Total ~6.5-7 km.
END:VEVENT

