UID:run-20260912-long@running-plan
DTSTAMP:20260909T070000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260912T090000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260912T110000
SUMMARY:Run - Long Run 14-16 km
DESCRIPTION:14-16 km easy @ 5:45-6:00/km. Optional final 2 km around 5:30/km if feeling very good.
END:VEVENT

