END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:run-20260917-hm-sharpening@running-plan
DTSTAMP:20260909T070000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260917T180000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260917T184500
SUMMARY:Run - HM Sharpening
DESCRIPTION:1.5 km warm-up + 2 km @ 5:30/km + 1.5 km cool-down. Keep it controlled.
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:run-20260920-hm@running-plan
DTSTAMP:20260909T070000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260920T090000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260920T110000
SUMMARY:🏁 Half Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Target ~5:30/km. Start first 3-5 km around 5:35-5:40/km. Settle near 5:30/km. Only accelerate after 15-17 km if feeling strong.
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:run-20260922-recovery@running-plan
DTSTAMP:20260909T070000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260922T180000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260922T184500
SUMMARY:Run - Recovery
DESCRIPTION:4-5 km very easy @ 6:20-6:40/km. Only run if adequately recovered from the HM.
END:VEVENT

