DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20261001T190000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20261001T193000
SUMMARY:🏁 5K Race
DESCRIPTION:Target ~4:30/km (~22:30). First km 4:30-4:35. Settle around 4:30/km. Push from km 4 and give everything in the final km.
